<div class="contact-panel"><div><p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot" aria-hidden="true"></span>OPEN TO WHAT’S NEXT</p><p class="contact-title">Let’s make something<br /><em>worth building.</em></p><p class="contact-description">A role, a project, or a good conversation.<br />I’d love to hear what you’re thinking.</p><a class="button" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>Say hello <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></div><div class="contact-side"><span class="contact-spark" aria-hidden="true">✳</span><a class="contact-email" href={`mailto:${profile.email}`}>{profile.email} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a><div class="social-links"><a href={profile.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">GitHub ↗</a><a href={profile.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">LinkedIn ↗</a><a href={`tel:${profile.phoneHref}`}>Phone ↗</a></div></div></div>
